<title>POLAND: Optimus Q1 net rises to PLN 10.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus Q1 net rises to PLN 10.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.91 vs	6.20</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  14.50 vs	4.77</p>
<p>    net profit				10.10 vs	2.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Optimus SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				111.83 vs    109.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 108.62 vs    103.43</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 4.40 vs	2.05</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    17.60 vs	0.51</p>
<p>    financial costs			  6.01 vs	1.95</p>
<p>    investment				 2.04 vs	0.44</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
